      "created_at": "2017-12-10T16:29:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Recently got into Sentinels via the digital version, and as a long time fan of comic books and strategy games, I’m loving it so far!</p><p>However, I’d like to read up on the characters and storyline a bit more - I have read all the Multiverse stuff in the digital game, and gleaned some things from context in a few places, but would like to know where / how to find out more - is there any other written material I should be looking for, or is everything else fleshed out by the letters page podcast?</p><p>Thanks for any help you can give me!</p>",
