      "created_at": "2017-12-10T17:23:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher and Adam’s mind.</p>\n<p>But lacking that where those fine folk said. And welcome to our madness, where we piece together their world. The flavor text gives alot of insights, even if a few are off or have weird answers for them. (La Capitan’s face on mount Rush more was passed a Miss Information thing till some Writer retcon it and said it was Maria Helena all along. . .)<br>\nBut seriously I love the “Writers” sub multiverse. I need to remeber the universes names. Anyone have that memorized? I just remeber MistStrom.</p>",
