      "created_at": "2017-12-10T18:03:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Of note that there's a few actual comics, as well.</p><p><a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=ARG_Event\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The ARG comics</a> are littered with various little interesting looks at events and personalities.</p><p>The Tactics games have actual minicomics in the scenario books.</p><p>And there's a <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comic\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">free comic about the forming of the Freedom Five</a>.</p><p>But otherwise, yeah, it's mainly the Multiverse and the Letters Page.</p>",
